  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "While groups are allowed to create verified 18+ only instances, they can't create posts that only verified 18+ group members can see, unless they were to make a special role for them, and assign it to them all manually.\n\nHaving the option to create posts only verified 18+ group members can see, would make it easier for VRChat groups to communicate info about adult only events they may be hosting, and would also make it more consistent with the group instance creation options.\n\nFurthermore, if this were implemented in a way, that a post only verified 18+ group members could see had the icon/subscript that only verified 18+ members could see it, like how it is when pinging specific group roles, it would help make it clearer what posts in vrhcat players' notifications are meant only for adults across all of their groups, and which are for everyone, which could be helpful, since if groups are making special roles for this purpose, there's no guarantee they'll have the same name, which could make it confusing, if different groups mean different things with roles like that (such as a general age verified role, or this role is specifically for members engaging in adult content with the role's respective group), and even more the case, in multilingual groups, because of language barriers.",
